' F8 -- The ingestion pipeline, five observable phases.
' HERO FIGURE. Chapter 4.
' Claim supported: a single live pipeline (v5 "unified") transforms an uploaded
' PDF into structured content. Admission control happens before enqueue; all
' content persistence is server-authoritative inside the worker.
' NOTE: swimlanes and `partition` cannot be mixed in PlantUML activity
' diagrams. Phases are therefore rendered as shaded header steps.
@startuml f8-pipeline
!include _style.iuml

title Ingestion pipeline -- from uploaded PDF to structured content

|#F2F2F2|API request (synchronous)|
start
:POST /api/v1/upload/parse-pdf-stream;
:capped streaming body read;

if (valid PDF or PPTX?\nsize <= 50 MB, pages <= 300) then (no)
  #DCDCDC:HTTP 413 / 400;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:**sha256(bytes)**\nthe pipeline's primary key;
note right
  Content addressing drives the storage
  path, run identity, the dedupe lock
  and the embedding cache alike.
end note

if (Arq queue depth < 50?) then (no)
  #DCDCDC:HTTP 429\nworker-liveness-aware message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

:store PDF at pdf-uploads/[sha256].pdf;
:enqueue Arq job;
:subscribe to Redis pubsub  parse:[sha256];

|#DCDCDC|Arq worker (asynchronous, durable)|
:claim job;

if (run already completed?) then (yes)
  :replay slides + deck from DB;
  #F2F2F2:emit complete;
  stop
else (no)
endif

if (acquire lock  joblock:parse:[hash]?) then (no)
  :another worker holds it,\nreturn early;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

#BFBFBF:**phase: extract**;
:PyMuPDF per-page text extraction;
:detect source language;
if (LLM budget headroom\n>= pages + 2?) then (no)
  #DCDCDC:InsufficientHeadroomError;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

#BFBFBF:**phase: enhance**;
:lecture title, summary, key topics;
:create or reuse lecture row\n//re-parse keeps lecture_id//;
:render WebP poster from page 1;
if (slide text length?) then (25 chars or more)
  :batched text synthesis\n8 slides per LLM call;
else (under 25 chars)
  :per-slide **vision** model\nvision_routed = true;
endif
:persist slides\nai_enhanced, needs_review, vision_routed;

#BFBFBF:**phase: finalize**;
:generate deck quiz questions;
:persist quiz_questions;
:update lecture description + slide count;
:localise EN / DE;
:attach lecture_id to embeddings\n//written earlier keyed by hash only//;
:emit deck_complete + complete;
stop

|#F2F2F2|Fire and forget (not awaited)|
:per-slide embedding, semaphore 3;
note right
  Dispatched with asyncio.create_task and
  **never awaited**. A parse can report
  "complete" with embeddings still in
  flight, or lose them entirely if the
  worker process exits.
end note
stop

legend bottom
  One live pipeline. PARSER_VERSION selects nothing: any value other than 5 logs
  "retired" and runs this path (upload_service.py:258). Parser v3 -- the README's
  headline feature -- and v4 are archived in backend/_legacy/ with zero live importers.
  Ordinary exceptions here receive **no retry**: max_tries applies only to
  CancelledError and explicit RetryJob.
endlegend

@enduml
